{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in an array.\n    Returns float('inf') if there are zeroes but no non-zero elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    zeroes = 0\n    non_zeroes = 0\n    for num in arr:\n        if num == 0:\n            zeroes += 1\n        else:\n            non_zeroes += 1\n\n    if non_zeroes == 0:\n        return float('inf')\n    else:\n        return float(zeroes) / non_zeroes"}
