{"task_id": "Mbpp/244", "solution": "import math\ndef next_Perfect_Square(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the next perfect square strictly greater than the given number n.\n    For negative n, 0 is returned as the first non-negative perfect square.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be an integer\")\n\n    if n < 0:\n        return 0\n\n    floor_sqrt_n = math.isqrt(n)\n    next_root = floor_sqrt_n + 1\n    return next_root ** 2"}
