{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the first n even natural numbers, each raised to the fifth power.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_number = 2 * i\n        total_sum += even_number ** 5\n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a positive integer n.\n    Uses the identity: sum_{k even} C(n, k) = 2^(n-1) for n >= 1, and 1 for n == 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a non-negative integer\")\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n    return 1 << (n - 1)"}
