{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(nums):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of digits for each number in a given list.\n    Each number's digits are summed, and then these individual sums are aggregated.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for num in nums:\n        # Convert the number to its absolute value string representation\n        # to iterate through its digits.\n        s_num = str(abs(num))\n        for digit_char in s_num:\n            total_sum += int(digit_char)\n    return total_sum"}
