{"task_id": "Mbpp/454", "solution": "import re\ndef text_match_wordz(text: str, case_sensitive: bool = False) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the text contains a word with the letter 'z'.\n    The match is case-insensitive by default.\n    \"\"\"\n    WORDZ_CORE = r\"\\b\\w*z\\w*\\b\"\n    flags = 0\n    if not case_sensitive:\n        flags = re.IGNORECASE\n\n    pattern = re.compile(WORDZ_CORE, flags)\n    match = pattern.search(text)\n\n    return bool(match)"}
