{"task_id": "Mbpp/558", "solution": "def digit_distance_nums(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of per-digit absolute differences between two integers.\n    The numbers are right-aligned, and shorter numbers are padded with leading zeros.\n    \"\"\"\n    s_a = str(abs(a))\n    s_b = str(abs(b))\n\n    max_len = max(len(s_a), len(s_b))\n\n    # Pad with leading zeros to align digits\n    padded_s_a = s_a.zfill(max_len)\n    padded_s_b = s_b.zfill(max_len)\n\n    total_diff = 0\n    for i in range(max_len):\n        digit_a = int(padded_s_a[i])\n        digit_b = int(padded_s_b[i])\n        total_diff += abs(digit_a - digit_b)\n\n    return total_diff"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/560", "solution": "def union_elements(tup1, tup2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the union of elements from two tuples and returns them in sorted order.\n    Uses a set for deduplication before sorting.\n    \"\"\"\n    combined_elements = set(tup1).union(set(tup2))\n    sorted_elements = sorted(list(combined_elements))\n    return tuple(sorted_elements)"}
