{"task_id": "Mbpp/559", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum(nums):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum sum of a contiguous sublist in the given list using Kadane's algorithm.\n    Assumes the input list is non-empty and contains integers.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not nums:\n        raise ValueError(\"nums must be a non-empty list\")\n\n    max_so_far = nums[0]\n    current_max = nums[0]\n\n    for i in range(1, len(nums)):\n        current_max = nums[i] if nums[i] > current_max + nums[i] else current_max + nums[i]\n        max_so_far = current_max if current_max > max_so_far else max_so_far\n\n    return max_so_far"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\n    Assumes input `n` is a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    while n > 0:\n        total_sum += n % 10\n        n //= 10\n    return total_sum"}
