{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def rotate_right(items, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates a list to the right by a specified number of items.\n    Returns a new list with the rotated elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    items_list = list(items)\n    n = len(items_list)\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n\n    effective_k = k % n\n    return items_list[-effective_k:] + items_list[:-effective_k]"}
