{"task_id": "Mbpp/803", "solution": "import math\ndef is_perfect_square(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given number is a perfect square.\n    Negative numbers are not considered perfect squares.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"is_perfect_square expects an int\")\n    if n < 0:\n        return False\n    root = math.isqrt(n)\n    return root * root == n"}
