{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if each element of the second tuple `b` is strictly smaller than its corresponding\n    element in the first tuple `a`. Assumes valid input tuples of equal length and numeric elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    for x, y in zip(a, b):\n        if not (x > y):\n            return False\n    return True"}
